[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 27075.67, "timestamp": "07:31:15", "text": "煩人了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27083.43, "timestamp": "07:31:23", "text": "喔不，我從上面的平台掉下來了。是啊。你好，Romp。你要去嗎？嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27085.59, "timestamp": "07:31:25", "text": "我撞到甜甜圈了，對吧？你會被錘子推一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27089.59, "timestamp": "07:31:29", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27097.91, "timestamp": "07:31:37", "text": "你只需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27100.31, "timestamp": "07:31:40", "text": "把握好時機。我們現在排名第12。17。好的。 [音樂] 我們需要它。第11名。是的，我們是第11名。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27104.548, "timestamp": "07:31:44", "text": "呃，我們有機會晉級。哦，他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27107.19, "timestamp": "07:31:47", "text": "跳得好高。他成功了嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27109.27, "timestamp": "07:31:49", "text": "？等等，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27115.83, "timestamp": "07:31:55", "text": "想我們成功了。是的，我們成功了。我們成功了。你今天表現很棒。"}]